      "id": "F01",
      "severity": "blocking",
      "title": "test:architecture-browser fails on this commit",
      "detail": "The static batching added in witness-architecture.js merges every mesh that shares a material into one mesh, so the rendered-geometry guard now measures one inflated AABB per material instead of the authored part boxes. The Q01 roof walk is reported as torso collisions against q01-batched-q01-b-rubble and q01-batched-q01-b-stone. The PR-04 candidate (same machine, same day, same script) passes the same gate with 7 runs and 0 body/camera/geometry errors.",
      "impact": "Physics still uses the unbatched solids list, so this is a gate/measurement defect, not a proven in-game overlap. The legacy Q01 architecture gate cannot be closed on this commit until the guard measures per-part boxes.",
